#. de: Mit Ezel II. sprechen
#. fr: Retrouver Ezel II, à Lydha Lran
#. kind: objective
msgctxt "quest/036/BanPix005_03687:TEXT_BANPIX005_03687_TODO_03:1"
msgid "Speak with Ezel II."
msgstr "Поговорить с Эзелом II."

